# Miyu 的合集（施工 RL-5、RL-5补，设计 60 第二节、第五节第 2 条）：只依赖核心、终端、网页三个 formula。托盘程序是 cask
# miyu-applet，formula 依赖不了 cask，在 caveats 里说怎么装。
# Homebrew 的 formula 一定要有一个下载：用这一版的 SHA256SUMS（小，哈希由 `cargo xtask packaging` 照本地那份算），装进文档目录。
# 这个文件是模板，由 `cargo xtask packaging <标签> --sums <SHA256SUMS>` 填好，再推到 tap 仓库 miyu-agent/homebrew-miyu。
class MiyuAgent < Formula
  desc "AI assistant that runs on your own computer: core, terminal and web interfaces"
  homepage "https://github.com/miyu-agent/miyu"
  url "https://github.com/miyu-agent/miyu/releases/download/v@VERSION@/SHA256SUMS"
  version "@VERSION@"
  sha256 "@SHA256_SUMS@"
  license "AGPL-3.0-or-later"

  depends_on arch: :arm64
  depends_on :macos
  depends_on "miyu-core"
  depends_on "miyu-tui"
  depends_on "miyu-webui"

  def install
    doc.install "SHA256SUMS"
  end

  def caveats
    <<~EOS
      The tray app is a cask:
        brew install --cask miyu-agent/miyu/miyu-applet
    EOS
  end

  test do
    miyu = formula_opt_bin("miyu-core")/"miyu"
    assert_equal "miyu #{Formula["miyu-core"].version}", shell_output("#{miyu} --version").strip
  end
end
